          "en": "Supreme People's Court Supreme People's Procuratorate\nSupplementary Provisions on the Implementation of the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China\nin Determining the Charges (VIII)\nFa Shi No. 3 [2024]\n(Adopted at the 1,912th meeting of the Judicial Committee of the Supreme People's Court on 17 January 2024 and at the 20th meeting of the 14th Procuratorial Committee of the Supreme People's Procuratorate on 3 January 2024)\nIn accordance with Amendment (XII) to the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China (hereinafter referred to as \"Amendment (XII) to the Criminal Law\"), the \"Provisions of the Supreme People's Court on Determining the Charges in the Implementation of the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China\" and the \"Opinions of the Supreme People's Procuratorate on the Charges for Crimes Prescribed in the Specific Provisions of the Criminal Law\" are hereby amended as follows:\nThe charge prescribed in Article 169 of the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China (Article 3 of Amendment (XII) to the Criminal Law) is amended from \"the crime of converting State-owned assets into shares at a low price or selling them at a low price through malpractice for personal gain\" to \"the crime of converting the assets of a company or enterprise into shares at a low price or selling them at a low price through malpractice for personal gain\".\nThese Provisions shall come into force on 1 March 2024."
